 ### [Piecewise Quadratic Hermite Interpolation](4001-piecewise-quadratic-hermite-interpolation.md)
-A 1D method that splits an interval into two quadratic Bézier curves to satisfy four Hermite constraints (two values, two derivatives) exactly. It is chosen for its numerical stability and efficiency in root computation compared to cubic methods.
